message: If you use BOMLLM in your research or writing, please cite it as below.
title: "BOMLLM: a production-proven self-hosted LLM platform on Apple Silicon"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: BOMLLM contributors
    name: BOMLLM contributors
repository-code: https://github.com/siamcafe/bomllm
url: https://github.com/siamcafe/bomllm
license: MIT
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-10-07"
keywords:
  - self-hosted
  - llm
  - apple-silicon
  - mlx
  - ollama
  - litellm
  - open-webui
  - thai
  - inference
abstract: >-
  BOMLLM is an open-source operations kit for running a production
  multi-channel LLM platform on a Mac Mini, replacing per-token cloud
  API spend with fixed-cost local inference. It ships the configs,
  sampling recipes, benchmark harness, and cost methodology measured
  in production since August 2026.
